6. Accordingly, the following order:
ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part;
(ii) The claimants are entitled to total compensation of Rs.12,89,200/- along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till the date of realization, as against Rs.11,48,100/- awarded by the tribunal;
NC: 2025:KHC-K:7384 HC-KAR (iii) The Insurance company is directed to deposit the enhanced compensation of Rs.1,41,100/-
along with interest within one month from the date of this order;
(iv) On such deposit, claimant No.1/husband of the deceased alone is permitted to withdraw the enhanced amount along with interest;
(v) In view of the order dated 25.11.2025 passed by this Court, the claimants are not entitled to interest for the delayed period of 343 days in filing the appeal.

